{"id":"en_engaged-to-my-ex-fianc-s-brother","title":"Engaged to My Ex-Fiancé's Brother","titleEn":"Engaged to My Ex-Fiancé's Brother","description":"A woman finds herself betrothed to the sibling of the man she was once set to marry. The arrangement places her in a complicated position, bound to a new partner whose family ties connect directly to her former engagement. Tension builds as she navigates the overlap between her past relationship and her present commitment, caught between two brothers and the history that links them all. The story follows how she handles the awkward and emotionally charged circumstances created by this unexpected pairing. For those interested in following this series, Dramzio provides a place to watch it.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_engaged-to-my-ex-fiance-s-brother/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_engaged-to-my-ex-fiance-s-brother/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","توتر رومانسي","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_engaged-to-my-ex-fianc-s-brother_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_engaged-to-my-ex-fianc-s-brother_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_engaged-to-my-ex-fianc-s-brother_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"